module.exports = "<div style=\"margin-top:90px;margin-bottom: 10px;padding: 17px 102px;text-align: justify\">\n  <h3>Introduction</h3>\n  Bizmobia, previously known as NCVAS, is a known name in growing market of Mobile Value Added Services (MVAS), Mobile Applications, Software Development, Apps Development and Internet Products & Services. We are very big known name in content distributer and Software development. Our mission is to deliver all type of entertainment content through all platforms of Digital Media Globally and having valuable years of experience in software and Apps Development, using the latest technologies . \n  <br><br>\n  BizMobia has association with more than 20 operators in 30 countries includes India, SEA and MEA. We have more than 1 billion successful downloads.\n  <br><br>\n  Thank you for being with us, as we assure you for security of information required for using our any product and we will never let you down. Please read the follwoing information and statement from us to understand our privacy policy\n<br><br>\n<h3>Personal identifications</h3>\nWhen you use our product either Mobile App or Web Application, the basic personal information provided by is never shared with any third party client \nWe use data collection devices such as \"cookies\" on certain pages of the Website to help analyse our web page flow, measure promotional effectiveness, and promote trust and safety. \"Cookies\" are small files placed on your hard drive that assist us in providing our services. We offer certain features that are only available through the use of a \"cookie\".\n <br><br>           \nGet A Free Quote / Need a Help ? Contact Us\n<br><br><br>\n<h3>About Us</h3>\nBizMobia is dedicated to delivering all of our clients the same high standard of project execution and excellence. Every business is unique and it is critical that your online presence, Mobile App or Software tool distinguishes you from your competition.\n</div>\n"

